        "review": "I've been fortunate enough to have played this game through all stages of its development. \n\nIt really is a fun game and reminds me of my childhood nostalgia PC games like Commander Keen, Crystal Caves etc... \n\nThe audio soundtrack also adds to the nostalgic effect and while I've played through the early levels a few times, I still find them challenging. \n\nThe developer really has listened to community feedback and the result is a very polished and fun game.\n\nI highly recommend this game for any indie game collectors and I'm looking forward to the next title from Conti Games!",
